                {
                  "entity": "input_boolean.bsb_thermostat_override",
                  "name": "Ignore room thermostat during cycle"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "input_number.bsb_heat_flow_ceiling",
                  "name": "Maximum requested HC1 flow"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "{{ states('input_text.bsb_calendar_status') }}\n\n**Events = 50°C return; gaps = 40°C return.** Adjustable above. Starts below target by 2°C, with at least 10 minutes between cycles. The cycle requests a flow setting 5°C above its return target and restores the original contact interpretation and flow setting afterward.\n\n[Add or edit heating periods](/calendar) · Schedule pauses after a server restart."
            },
            {
              "type": "calendar",
              "entities": [
                "calendar.heating"
              ],
              "initial_view": "listWeek"
            }
          ]
